    "detailed_description": "Wing Haven is a relaxing idle game about building cozy bird sanctuaries. Progress from a basic enclosure to a beautiful nature preserve in old-growth forest, desert oasis, or wetland climates!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect rare and exotic feathered friends and watch them grow in real-time! Open bird &quot;packs&quot; with over 75 unique bird species in common, rare, epic and legendary varieties, with exciting rare color variants!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnhance your ecosystem with native plants that boost your birds growth and earnings!",
